:''For more uses of "Sakura" see [[Sakura (disambiguation)]].''
'''Sakura the Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel]] collaboration gacha event. She was added in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.2 Update|Version 8.2]] increases health and gains chance to knockback Metal enemies.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 370
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Sakura the Cat
|name2 = Apron Sakura Cat
|name3 = Dreaming Sakura Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Apron Sakura Cat''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Dreaming Sakura Cat''' at level 30 using [[Catfruit]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
Sakura the Cat is easily compared to [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Jurassic Cat Sitter]] with very similar stats. Both units have true forms but Catasaurus is better then Dreaming Sakura Cat in almost every way. Dreaming Sakura only gains an irrelevant defense buff in true form and knockback vs metal where she gets outclassed by [[Bronze Cat (Rare Cat)|Bronze Cat]].

{{Job|Classification = Critter}}

